*                                                                          *
*   Description   : Replaces the classic and AP-class compact              *
*                   UIBasicInfoWnd draw branches in the 2025-07-16         *
*                   Ragexe with the supplied 280x70 HP/SP/AP HUD.           *
*                   It draws the live Base Level, character name, all      *
*                   three gauge values and percentages, creates a native   *
*                   67x70 Job icon child, adds native Job/gauge hover      *
*                   tooltips, preserves the two legacy title buttons in    *
*                   Classic UI, suppresses them only in New UI, and forces *
*                   Alt+V to retain the compact layout. The AP             *
*                   values reuse the client's SP_AP/SP_MAXAP stat map      *
*                   populated by AllowAPBarforAllJobs. QJS-only.           *
*                                                                          *
\**************************************************************************/

